abstract: "Simulation and analysis code for the Gamma-Code Consensus (GCC), including synthetic Kuramoto network experiments, EEG pilot analysis, HCP-derived Budapest Reference Connectome topology stress tests, OpenNeuro ds006623 fMRI validation, OpenNeuro ds003367 traumatic coma/DoC HARDI structural backbone analyses, and OpenNeuro ds004504 neurodegenerative EEG P1-proxy analyses."
